			"notes": "This patch fixes connection issues, standardizes all commands and messages to English by default, and unifies builds into a single universal JAR for Minecraft 26.x.\n\n\n  * Removed premature map packet bursts on player connect; maps are now streamed naturally via proximity.\n  * Added channel capability checks (`ServerPlayNetworking.canSend`) to ensure custom network payloads are never sent to vanilla or Bedrock clients.\n\n* **Language System & English Defaults:**\n  * Standardized all command syntax, arguments, autocompletions (`<name>`, `<url>`, `<width>`, `<height>`, etc.), and help messages to **100% English (`en_US`) by default** (matching the original Spigot plugin 1:1).\n  * Integrated official Crowdin translation support with automatic translation updates in `config/imageframe/language/`.\n  * Added `/imageframe language <lang>` and `/imageframe reload` commands to easily change languages on the fly.\n  * In-game client toasts now automatically adapt to the player's client language (English, Spanish, German, French, Chinese, etc.).\n\n* **Unified 26.x Release:**\n  * A single JAR now natively supports **Minecraft 26.1.2, 26.2, and future 26.x versions**."
		},
